	<string>POPOPX uses Bluetooth to discover nearby POPOPX devices and exchange messages offline when there is no internet connection.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>用于在聊天中向联系人发送您当前的位置或自定义地图坐标，位置数据仅通过端到端加密通道传输。</string>
	<key>NSNearbyInteractionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>POPOPX uses nearby interaction to measure the distance to a device you are meeting in person, so that adding a friend only happens when you are within arm's reach. No location is read or stored.</string>
